    narr:narration """This narrative fixes an ordering: [steering first, then recall, then precision as the applied result](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_19), introduced under [the order every reader follows](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_18). ScarletDame grounds it in [statements as support for direction, never ends in themselves](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_21), extends it to [every consumer including the room agent](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_20), and rejects [frame-plus-sample as a design](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_23). The composer draws [the judge-sees-the-position-whole consequence](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_24).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_18> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_19> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_20> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_21> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_23> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_24> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "You need steering first, and then you need the recall of the full set of things to consider, and then applying the result of steering, the navigated context, to the recalled choices becomes precision." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_19> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "A statement is always support for a direction, not an end in itself." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_21> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "I don't think frame plus a selection of statements is ever a good design or was ever a good design." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_23> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Consequence: a judge, or any reader deciding relevance, sees a position whole, frame and every member statement, never a sample of three." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_24> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The frame-only question is left open, not settled: whether a frame alone can locate relevance gets the answer \"maybe.\"" ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_23> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Scarlet flags her own framing as possibly off — the cite prompt's wording \"should probably get ticketed\" under the read pass epic." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_21> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "flat claim-register — positions stated as settled assertions, with one open \"maybe\" where the design question is genuinely undecided" ; narr:text "I don't think frame plus a selection of statements is ever a good design or was ever a good design." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_23> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "antithesis-first — the sentence names what a thing is not before saying what it is" ; narr:text "A statement is always support for a direction, not an end in itself." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_21> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "temporal" ; narr:reading "abstract-present — principles stated in the timeless present, with a realis edge when turning to what should be done" ; narr:text "That actually might not be quite what the cite prompt says and should probably get ticketed and looked at as part of the read pass epic." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_21> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "power" ; narr:reading "expert — speaks from design authority over what frames are for" ; narr:text "The frame is designed to be the frame through which its statements are read and that combination produces meaning" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_23> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "value" ; narr:reading "competence — the concern is whether the design actually works, judged by what it loses" ; narr:text "I think that the frame only is unquestionably losing something." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_23> ] ;
